kpi Customers affected | 12,900

## Summary
A configuration change lowered the Billing API's database connection pool from 200 to 20. With too few connections, requests queued behind the pool and timed out, pushing the error rate as high as 38.5%. The change was rolled back and errors returned to baseline 47 minutes after the deploy.

