chart line errors x=time y=error rate unit=% title="Billing API error rate, 5-minute intervals"

## Root cause
The pool size was changed in a routine config update that passed review and the config linter. At 20 connections the pool could not keep up with normal traffic, so requests waited for a free connection until they hit their timeout. Because the change looked like a tuning tweak, responders took about half an hour to connect the errors to pool exhaustion.

! The config linter did not validate pool size bounds, so a value 90% below the previous setting shipped without a warning.

